{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1238","id":3987196182,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p87tp8kW","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1238","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1238.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1238.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1238","number":1238,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"test: guard runtime availability against stale served-subset gates","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\nCloses #1207.\n\nAdds a local regression guard for runtime availability semantics so stale served-subset gates cannot silently return. The guard scans runtime, tests, scripts, and docs; writes a validator-backed stale-gate readback; and keeps served-subset artifacts preserved only as historical/calibration/source-comparison inputs.\n\n## Allowed vs Forbidden Reference Rules\n\nAllowed:\n- Historical governance evidence, owner-review calibration input, Method Map stronger-diagnostic candidate context, and source comparison/readback context.\n- `1203` may describe served-eligible diagnostic candidates, not the beta coverage ceiling.\n- `8` may describe owner-reviewed calibration rows, not the runtime availability boundary.\n\nForbidden:\n- No runtime availability gate may cap the beta question universe at 8 rows, 1203 rows, or served-subset-only rows.\n- No runtime registry, source adapter, smoke, Supabase rehearsal map, or docs-as-current-truth may treat served-subset artifacts as beta availability authority.\n- Explicit forbidden patterns include `legacyServedSubsetControlsAvailability: true`, `stale_8_row_gate_used: true`, `small_subset_gate_used: true`, stale `betaQuestionSet` values, and `slice(0, 8|1203)` availability caps.\n\n## Guard Command And Readback\n\nGuard command:\n\n```bash\nnode scripts/method-map/guard-runtime-availability-stale-gates.mjs --check\n```\n\nReadback output:\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/runtime-availability-stale-gate-readback.md`\n- Status: pass\n- Scanned files: 177\n- Scanned categories: docs, runtime, scripts, tests\n- Forbidden stale-gate violations: 0\n- Semantic checks: runtime registry full-3530 policy, source-map 3530 validator, posture-map stale flags false, Phase B 3530 rehearsal universe\n\n## No-Claim Boundaries\n\nThis PR does not claim launch readiness, official scoring readiness, rights approval, student-display-final status, or Phase B2 readiness. It performs no external VLM work, no remote Supabase mutation, no storage upload, and no frontend UI change.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `node scripts/method-map/guard-runtime-availability-stale-gates.mjs --check`\n- `node scripts/method-map/build-full-beta-runtime-source-map.mjs --check`\n- `node scripts/supabase/build-phase-b-full-9709-beta-source-map.mjs --check`\n- `npm test -- --runInBand scripts/method-map/__tests__/runtime-availability-stale-gate-guard.test.js scripts/method-map/__tests__/full-beta-runtime-source-map.test.js src/pages/paper-workspace/__tests__/full-beta-posture-source-adapter.test.js src/pages/paper-workspace/__tests__/full-beta-question-universe-registry.test.js scripts/smoke/__tests__/full-beta-text-only-runtime-smoke.test.js scripts/smoke/__tests__/full-beta-visual-blocked-runtime-smoke.test.js scripts/supabase/__tests__/phase-b-full-9709-beta-source-map.test.js --verbose`\n- `node --check scripts/method-map/guard-runtime-availability-stale-gates.mjs`\n- `npx eslint scripts/method-map/guard-runtime-availability-stale-gates.mjs scripts/method-map/__tests__/runtime-availability-stale-gate-guard.test.js`\n- `git diff --check`\n- `git diff --cached --check`\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json`\n\nPreflight result: top status `warning` only for branch ownership/ahead status; worktree cleanliness, report/artifact guard, and A+ ratchet were healthy.","created_at":"2026-07-03T16:04:13Z","updated_at":"2026-07-03T16:13:44Z","closed_at":"2026-07-03T16:13:44Z","merged_at":"2026-07-03T16:13:44Z","merge_commit_sha":"746e726dffa15d3ca1814fa0c2539817dfe1a5f5","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1238/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1238/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1238/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/ec6954a51721b8eb0b61504849a12fae12b67f54","head":{"label":"Samsen879:feat/issue-1207","ref":"feat/issue-1207","sha":"ec6954a51721b8eb0b61504849a12fae12b67f54","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://githu